            <title><![CDATA[House rejects Hegseth impeachment as GOP selects Jordan and Thune as leaders]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/house-rejects-hegseth-impeachment-as-gop-selects-jordan-and-thune-as-leaders</link>
            <description><![CDATA[Power shifts in Washington continued as new party leadership began to take shape. In the House, the GOP picked Jim Jordan to be their new leader and Senate Republicans re-elected John Thune. The House also voted to quash an effort to impeach Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth. Lisa Desjardins reports.]]></description>
